id: powerful-barrier
name: Powerful Barrier
advancement: true
prerequisite: 12+ Force or Magic Score
tpCost: 12
# Its Might Clash opened from Bound Battlefield's row (the user's): against the one targeted, the Energy Charges of their
# attack asked and 1(T) off your Dice Score for each. What winning does to the attack is the table's.
barrierClash: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Might Clash, 1(T) off per Energy Charge, against an attack across your Bound Squares: won, it cannot target them.
text: >
  Powerful Barrier: Your barrier defends against attacks as well.
  –Prerequisites: 12+ Force or Magic Score
  –TP Cost: 12
  –Effect: If a Character not occupying one of your Bound Squares targets a Character(s) occupying one of your Bound
  Squares with an Attacking Maneuver, or vice-versa, you may make a Might Clash against the attacking Character but
  reduce your Dice Score by 1(T) for every Energy Charge applied to that Attacking Maneuver. If you win, that Attacking
  Maneuver cannot target those Character(s) and if it has no targets as a result, it is cancelled. If it is cancelled,
  the attacking Character regains any Actions spent on that Attacking Maneuver but does not regain any Ki Points spent.
